  - src/shared.js carries two helpers taken from DS Bot's host so this package does not
    import another plugin's files: `output` (src/host/tools.js) and `replaceFile`
    (src/host/files.js).
  - The tools, board, plan, agenda, digest, skills and team modules were moved out of DS
    Bot's src/host/upsello/ into this package. The files carry a modification notice.
  - The four Bot instructions and the top rule come from the same source.

This plugin expects DS Bot's `botRuntime` service. It is not in DS Bot up to 0.3.2; the
fork at https://github.com/upsello/upsello-ds-bot adds that one line and nothing else.
